# Copy to .env.local for local development. Every variable is optional: the site builds and
# runs with none of them. On Vercel, set them in Project Settings -> Environment Variables.

# Canonical origin used in metadata, Open Graph URLs and the sitemap.
# Defaults to the Vercel production URL (VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL) or localhost.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=

# Nothing else. Applications go through the Google Form linked in content/site.ts
# (season.applyFormUrl) and messages by email, so the site needs no database or email
# service. The variables of the parked application portal and site forms (Supabase, Resend)
# are documented in parked/README.md.
